<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #FFFBFA; }
    .wrapper { background-color: #FFFBFA; padding: 40px 10px; font-family: 'Inter', 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; }
    .card { 
      max-width: 480px; 
      margin: 0 auto; 
      background-color: #ffffff; 
      border-radius: 32px; 
      padding: 48px 32px; 
      border: 1px solid #fafafa;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 40px -10px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05);
    }
    .logo { width: 80px; height: auto; margin-bottom: 24px; border-radius: 20px; }
    .title { 
      font-size: 24px; 
      font-weight: 900; 
      color: #0f172a; 
      text-transform: uppercase; 
      letter-spacing: -0.02em; 
      margin: 0 0 8px 0;
    }
    .subtitle { 
      font-size: 11px; 
      font-weight: 800; 
      color: #00BD9D; 
      text-transform: uppercase; 
      letter-spacing: 0.25em; 
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      display: block;
    }
    .text { 
      font-size: 14px; 
      line-height: 1.6; 
      color: #475569; 
      margin-bottom: 32px; 
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .btn { 
      display: inline-block; 
      background-color: #00BD9D; 
      color: #ffffff !important; 
      padding: 18px 36px; 
      border-radius: 20px; 
      text-decoration: none; 
      font-weight: 900; 
      font-size: 12px; 
      text-transform: uppercase; 
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    }
    .footer { 
      margin-top: 40px; 
      font-size: 9px; 
      font-weight: 800; 
      color: #cbd5e1; 
      text-transform: uppercase; 
      letter-spacing: 0.4em;
    }
    .divider { height: 1px; background-color: #fafafa; margin: 32px 0; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="card">
      <img src="<%= logoUrl %>" alt="Logo" class="logo">
      <h1 class="title">Reset Password</h1>
      <span class="subtitle">Mari Belajar Platform</span>
      
      <p class="text">
        Halo <strong><%= name %></strong>,<br>
        Kami menerima permintaan untuk merubah password akun kamu. Klik tombol di bawah untuk memprosesnya.
      </p>

      <a href="<%= resetLink %>" class="btn">Atur Ulang Password</a>

      <div class="divider"></div>

      <p class="text" style="font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 0;">
        Abaikan email ini jika kamu tidak merasa melakukan permintaan ini.
      </p>
      
      <div class="footer">
        &mdash; MARI BELAJAR &mdash;
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>